<body>

<div class="card">
  <h1>🧩 Company matcher <span class="sub">master vs. new list</span></h1>
  <p style="color: #2e405c;">Paste your <strong>master list</strong> (companies you already have) and the <strong>new list</strong> you want to check.  
  The tool compares <strong>name + URL</strong> and shows similarity % so you can decide if it’s a duplicate or a new entry.</p>
  <div class="example">📌 Format: one company per line → <code>Name, https://example.com</code>  (or just URL)</div>
</div>

<div class="grid-2">
  <div class="card">
    <label>📂 Master list (existing)</label>
    <textarea id="masterInput" placeholder="Paste your master list here...&#10;e.g.&#10;Google, https://google.com&#10;Microsoft, https://microsoft.com">Google, https://google.com
Microsoft, https://microsoft.com/about
Apple, https://apple.com</textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <label>📄 New list (to check)</label>
    <textarea id="newInput" placeholder="Paste the new list here...&#10;e.g.&#10;Google, https://google.com&#10;Alphabet, https://abc.xyz">Google, https://google.com
Alphabet, https://abc.xyz
Apple, https://apple.com
Microsoft, https://microsoft.com</textarea>
